h specific version of the claim gets narrowed down under scrutiny, so the definition keeps expanding to survive. That's usually a sign the underlying belief isn't actually about evidence — it's something you've settled on for other reasons, and each argument is being adjusted to protect it. That's worth reflecting on honestly, independent of what I say back to you.
